[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Public entry points
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m All seven exported symbols are driven directly via the `.so`, lowest-level
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m first — **not** only through the `modeselect` convenience wrapper:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 1. `classify_mode` (leaf)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2. `apply_multiplier` (leaf)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 3. `convert_time_factor` (leaf)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 4. `convert_negative_overflow` (leaf)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 5. `hash_time_value` (leaf)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 6. `get_modified_time` (leaf, calls `time()`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 7. `modeselect` (composes 1,2,5,6,3,4 + 8 `printf`s)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Table
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
