[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m fixed-seed PRNG (seed `0x5EED_1234_ABCD_0001`), not a single hand-picked value.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Row `[x]` means it passed across the whole randomized sweep.
