[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `modeselect` writes 8 `printf` lines as well as returning an `int`, so rows C35–
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    115[0m:[38;5;10m[49m C47 compare **both**. Both `.so`s call the process's libc `printf`, so fd 1 is
